pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$map"
elements:
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 50, 700, 20]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>MARKET · 市场机会</p>
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 78, 1120, 44]
    content:
      style: "$titleDark"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>500 亿市场，供给缺口肉眼可见</p>
  - elementId: titleBar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [80, 136, 44, 3]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$gold"}
  - elementId: marketChart
    elementType: chart
    bounds: [80, 170, 560, 420]
    type: bar
    data:
      - {year: "2022", size: 312}
      - {year: "2023", size: 380}
      - {year: "2024E", size: 430}
      - {year: "2025E", size: 500}
    x: year
    y: [size]
    names: ["市场规模"]
    colors: ["#B08A3E"]
    title: {text: "中国心理健康服务市场规模（亿元）", color: "#9BA3B5", fontSize: 14}
    legend: false
    dataLabels:
      show: true
      content: value
      color: "#EDEAE2"
      fontSize: 14
    options:
      barWidth: 0.5
      fontFamily: "MiSans"
    xAxis:
      label: {color: "#9BA3B5", fontSize: 13}
      axisLine: {style: solid, color: "#3A4358", width: 1}
      gridLine: false
    yAxis:
      show: false
  - elementId: m1num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [700, 178, 500, 56]
    content:
      fontSize: 46
      color: "$gold"
      fontFamily: "Liter, MiSans"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>9500 万</p>
  - elementId: m1label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [700, 240, 500, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      color: "$mapMuted"
      fontFamily: "MiSans"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>国内泛心理问题人群规模</p>
  - elementId: m2num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [700, 308, 500, 56]
    content:
      fontSize: 46
      color: "$gold"
      fontFamily: "Liter, MiSans"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>+18%</p>
  - elementId: m2label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [700, 370, 500, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      color: "$mapMuted"
      fontFamily: "MiSans"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>市场年复合增长率（2023–2025E）</p>
  - elementId: m3num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [700, 438, 500, 56]
    content:
      fontSize: 46
      color: "$gold"
      fontFamily: "Liter, MiSans"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>22%</p>
  - elementId: m3label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [700, 500, 500, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      color: "$mapMuted"
      fontFamily: "MiSans"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>互联网心理健康服务增速，跑赢大盘</p>
  - elementId: minsightBar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [700, 556, 3, 44]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$gold"}
  - elementId: minsight
    elementType: text
    bounds: [718, 552, 482, 52]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$mapText"
      fontFamily: "MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      text: |
        <p>LifeFork 切入心理咨询与泛娱乐之间的空白带：结构化自我探索。</p>
  - elementId: source
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 648, 1000, 16]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      color: "$mapMuted"
      fontFamily: "MiSans"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>数据来源：观研天下（2025）、艾瑞咨询；市场规模为中国心理健康服务市场整体口径。</p>
  - elementId: footer
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 688, 420, 16]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      color: "$mapMuted"
      fontFamily: "MiSans"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>LifeFork · 人生岔路 — 公测路演</p>
  - elementId: pageNum
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1100, 688, 100, 16]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      color: "$mapMuted"
      fontFamily: "Liter, MiSans"
      align: [right, top]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>10 / 14</p>
